---
/**
 * PrivacyContent — bilingual privacy statement.
 *
 * Human, is a small education collective. We collect almost nothing online.
 * This page says so plainly.
 */
---
<section class="section">
  <div class="container prose">
    <div lang="en-CA">
      <p class="label">Privacy</p>
      <h1>What we collect, and what we don't.</h1>
      <p>
        Human, an Education Collective is a small, privately-owned tutoring
        practice. The website you're reading does not run analytics, does
        not set cookies for advertising, and does not have third-party
        trackers embedded in it.
      </p>
      <h2>What we collect on this website.</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Nothing. The site is fully static. We don't have a server
          that logs your visit or stores your data.</li>
        <li>If you click through to Instagram, Facebook, or WhatsApp from
          our contact section, those platforms have their own privacy
          policies that apply.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>What we collect when we work together.</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Name and contact details for the student, a parent or
          guardian, and any authorised billing contact.</li>
        <li>Lesson notes, student work, and progress records, so we can
          teach well and refer back to what we've done.</li>
        <li>Payment information, only the minimum needed to invoice and
          receive payment. We don't store credit card numbers; those live
          with our payment processor.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Who we share with.</h2>
      <p>
        No one outside our practice, unless you tell us to. Exceptions are
        legally required disclosures, which is an unusual situation for a
        tutoring service to be in.
      </p>
      <h2>How long we keep things.</h2>
      <p>
        Lesson notes and student work: for as long as you are a student with
        us, plus two years afterward. Billing records: seven years, because
        Canadian tax authorities ask for that. Everything else: we delete
        it when it's no longer needed.
      </p>
      <h2>Your rights.</h2>
      <p>
        You can ask us what we have about you, ask us to correct it, or
        ask us to delete it. Reach us at <a href="mailto:hi@nicojan.com">hi@nicojan.com</a>
        and we'll respond within 14 days.
      </p>
      <p class="caption">Last updated: April 2026.</p>
    </div>

    <hr style="margin-block: var(--space-16); border: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-default);" />

    <div lang="zh-Hant">
      <p class="label">隱私政策</p>
      <h1>我們收集什麼，不收集什麼。</h1>
      <p>
        「人本・共學社」是一個小型的私人家教單位。
        您現在讀的這個網站沒有分析工具、沒有廣告 cookie、沒有任何第三方追蹤器。
      </p>
      <h2>在這個網站上，我們收集哪些資料？</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>零。整個網站都是靜態的，沒有會記錄您造訪或儲存您資料的伺服器。</li>
        <li>如果您從聯絡區塊點到 Instagram、Facebook、WhatsApp，這些平台有它們自己的隱私政策。</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>實際合作時，我們會收集哪些資料？</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>學生、家長／監護人、以及帳務聯絡人的姓名與聯絡方式。</li>
        <li>課堂筆記、學生作品、學習進度紀錄，方便我們好好教，也方便回頭看做過的東西。</li>
        <li>付款資訊，只會收到開立發票與收款必要的最少資料。信用卡號不會存在我們手上，是由金流服務商保管。</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>我們會把資料分享給誰？</h2>
      <p>
        除非您另外同意，我們不會把資料給任何人。唯一的例外是法律要求揭露，但對家教服務而言這種情況非常少見。
      </p>
      <h2>資料會保存多久？</h2>
      <p>
        課堂筆記與學生作品：學生上課期間，再加結束後兩年。
        帳務紀錄：七年，因為加拿大稅務機關會要求保留。
        其他的，不再需要時就刪除。
      </p>
      <h2>您的權利。</h2>
      <p>
        您可以來問我們手上有您哪些資料、請我們更正，或請我們刪除。
        來信 <a href="mailto:hi@nicojan.com">hi@nicojan.com</a>，我們會在十四天內回覆。
      </p>
      <p class="caption">最後更新：2026 年 4 月。</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
